OL,3,GNEWSAMore budget talks due as O'Dowd
OL,4,Awarns 'crunch point' looming
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government had offered them an
OL,7,Fadditional #525m this year, but they
OL,8,Fsaid it still left significant gaps in
OL,9,Fmanaging their spending pressures,
OL,10,Fparticularly delivery of pay awards for
OL,11,Fpublic sector workers.
